      "type": "game",
      "name": "CraftCraft: Fantasy Merchant Simulator",
      "steam_appid": 2226430,
      "required_age": 0,
      "is_free": false,
      "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226430/extras/70fdc0cc8dd9edd0e4b198212cd99f8e.poster.avif?t=1768814723\" width=616 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226430/extras/70fdc0cc8dd9edd0e4b198212cd99f8e.webm?t=1768814723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226430/extras/70fdc0cc8dd9edd0e4b198212cd99f8e.mp4?t=1768814723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>CraftCraft is made by a small fully indie studio who made Death and Taxes.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ Become a jeweler or a smith in a quaint port town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ Create a moth / elf / cat character!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  ✧ Meet a lot of different folks and impact their lives. Your choices matter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ Have a cute owlcat as a pet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ Relax and craft! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ Make <i>shiny</i> stuff. ✧ ⋆ ˙ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ Make even MORE <i>shiny</i> stuff. ⋆ ˙ ✧ + *  ˙ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ✧ Make less <i>shiny</i> and more <strong>ominous</strong> stuff.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Includes:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ Full voice acting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ Short branching story spanning 11 in game days. About 5-8 hours to finish the game once. (+ a non-story endless mode)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  ✧ Replayability (multiple backgrounds with unique characters tied to it, some random scavangables and multiple endings). <br> <br>✧ Original soundtrack using real folk instruments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ Completely unique crafting simulation </p>",
      "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226430/extras/70fdc0cc8dd9edd0e4b198212cd99f8e.poster.avif?t=1768814723\" width=616 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226430/extras/70fdc0cc8dd9edd0e4b198212cd99f8e.webm?t=1768814723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226430/extras/70fdc0cc8dd9edd0e4b198212cd99f8e.mp4?t=1768814723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>CraftCraft is made by a small fully indie studio who made Death and Taxes.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ Become a jeweler or a smith in a quaint port town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ Create a moth / elf / cat character!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  ✧ Meet a lot of different folks and impact their lives. Your choices matter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ Have a cute owlcat as a pet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ Relax and craft! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ Make <i>shiny</i> stuff. ✧ ⋆ ˙ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ Make even MORE <i>shiny</i> stuff. ⋆ ˙ ✧ + *  ˙ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ✧ Make less <i>shiny</i> and more <strong>ominous</strong> stuff.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Includes:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ Full voice acting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ Short branching story spanning 11 in game days. About 5-8 hours to finish the game once. (+ a non-story endless mode)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  ✧ Replayability (multiple backgrounds with unique characters tied to it, some random scavangables and multiple endings). <br> <br>✧ Original soundtrack using real folk instruments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✧ Completely unique crafting simulation </p>",
      "short_description": "CraftCraft is a narrative-heavy RPG sim with hands on forging and jewelry making! Create a pretty tiara for a mermaid or a sword made of dragon blood! Be a Moth or a Cat and express your creativity in your cozy crafting studio and change the lives of locals in the mysterious port town of Windspell.",
      "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
      "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226430/header.jpg?t=1768814723",
